# License

This project uses Chinese character stroke data from [hanzi-writer-data](https://github.com/chanind/hanzi-writer-data), which is derived from the [Make Me A Hanzi](https://github.com/skishore/makemeahanzi) project.

The stroke data is licensed under the **Arphic Public License**:

- [hanzi-writer-data/ARPHICPL.TXT](hanzi-writer-data/ARPHICPL.TXT) (English)
- [hanzi-writer-data/ARPHICPL.TXT](hanzi-writer-data/ARPHICPL.TXT) (Chinese Simplified)

